# Build context hygiene. docker/Dockerfile's context is the REPO ROOT (it COPYs
# scripts/fetch_omvll.sh, so it cannot be docker/ any more) - without this file the whole
# working tree goes to the daemon, and output/ alone holds multi-hundred-MB APKs.
#
# Adapted from the .dockerignore on the obfuscate-polymorphic-stub branch; `assets/` is gone
# (it was split three ways and retired), and the four generated directories that replaced it
# are listed instead.
.git
.github

# The four generated/large directories (see CLAUDE.md "Directory layout" and .gitignore).
output/
out/
artifacts/
test_apks/
vendor/
build/

# ~65-95 MB of fetched plugin + CPython stdlib. The image fetches its own copy into /opt/omvll
# using the pinned script, so shipping a host copy in the context is pure waste.
third_party/omvll/

# The submodule's own fetched trees, same reasoning.
third_party/whitebox-cryptography/third_party/libsodium/
third_party/whitebox-cryptography/third_party/omvll/
third_party/whitebox-cryptography/third_party/python/
third_party/whitebox-cryptography/build-android/
third_party/whitebox-cryptography/build-host/

**/*.apk
**/*.aab
**/*.so.orig
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
*.egg-info/
